# Triangulation Rocks (CIPlay triangulation_rocks): the camp at 3 m round 0 -2; the orders, the camp chest, the vines,
# relay 1 and its boars, the fuel cache, relay 2 and its locker, relay 3's lever refused before its code, a wrong code,
# the code, the lever, the locker.
island Triangulation Rocks
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Three Bearings
zone survey_camp
expect step 1
read Survey orders
expect step 2
open Survey camp
wait 3
expect step 3
expect item Machete 1
use cleftvines
expect hidden cleftvines
zone relay_1
expect step 4
kill Warthog
